# Feature-Sliced Design

Import direction: `app → features → entities → shared`.

## Do
- Features import entities and shared only
- RPC types come from `packages/rpc`, never duplicated in the UI
- Domain DTOs come from `packages/domain`

## Do not
- Features importing other features
- Copying RPC payload types into `apps/mobile`

Read `.cursor/skills/fsd-monorepo/SKILL.md`.
